#
# The server's refusal of an OCITransStart on a session that logged on without
# the XA names: ORA-02048, Oracle 8.1.7 (#2807).
# Captured 2026-11-26 from an OCI 9.2 program (OCITransStart, OCITransDetach, OCITransPrepare,
# OCITransCommit and OCITransRollback, with XIDs of format 2807, gtrid
# 'gtrid' and a letter, bqual 'bq' and the same letter) run on the 9i VM
# (x86-64 Linux), under tcpdump.
# The TTC payload, without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the
# offset column and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  04 00 00 00 00 00 08 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01  |................|
00000010  00 40 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |.@..............|
00000020  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 07  00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000030  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 47 4f 52 41  |............GORA|
00000040  2d 30 32 30 34 38 3a 20  61 74 74 65 6d 70 74 20  |-02048: attempt |
00000050  74 6f 20 62 65 67 69 6e  20 64 69 73 74 72 69 62  |to begin distrib|
00000060  75 74 65 64 20 74 72 61  6e 73 61 63 74 69 6f 6e  |uted transaction|
00000070  20 77 69 74 68 6f 75 74  20 6c 6f 67 67 69 6e 67  | without logging|
00000080  20 6f 6e 0a                                       | on.|
00000084
